SUMMARY:Boulder Group Annual Dinner and 2027 Kickoff
DESCRIPTION:Join the Boulder Group for an evening of good food\, good frien
 ds\, and good times.  There will be time to socialize with old friends and
  new acquaintances\, a short business section to recap 2026 and plan for 2
 027\, and dinner provided by Sherpa's Restaurant.  This year's speaker is 
 Erin Ton\, a Colorado-born mountain endurance athlete who spends most of h
 er time trail running and scrambling alpine ridgelines across the West. Sh
 e’s set well over 100 FKTs on peaks from Colorado 14ers\, to the Grand C
 anyon\, and the Himalayas.  And\, we will conclude the evening with an ext
 ra hour of mingling\, dancing\, etc.\n\nConfirm meeting details and regist
 ration with CMC. Calendar listing is not registration.\nhttps://www.cmc.or
 g/community/front-range-groups/boulder/calendar-of-events-trips-and-course
 s/upcoming-boulder-group-events-trips-and-courses/ical-view
